# Browser-only app — no server, no secrets. The only key is Census (free,
# public-data, safe to expose client-side): https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html
# REQUIRED as of this Census API vintage, not just recommended for high
# volume — confirmed live, every unkeyed ACS request now returns an HTML
# "Missing Key" page rather than throttled data. Without it, tract
# boundaries (the map/point-in-polygon geometry) still work; only the
# actual population counts stay unavailable, and the Population panel says
# so explicitly rather than silently showing zero.
VITE_CENSUS_API_KEY=
